Cell["\<\
M is the Mass, and A is the specific angular momentum A=J/M where J is the \
angular momentum (I use \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]A\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
rather than \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]a\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] because I use \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]a\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] as an abstract index)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96062572452435*^9, 3.9606257389408655`*^9}, {
  3.960625783277297*^9, 3.9606258330795617`*^9}, {3.985065051878278*^9, 
